  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞美食广场……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞伙伴们正神情严肃地商量着什么……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 02 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}是你啊，来得正好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}刚才和善聊的时候，\n有件事让我有点在意。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}刚才的迷宫里，\n不是有蜘蛛吗。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}就是不知道从哪儿啪嗒一下掉下来，\n把岳羽吓得够呛的那个。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}总觉得很在意……\n虽然不知道为什么。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}有蜘蛛很奇怪吗？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 09 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}你有关于蜘蛛的记忆？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 09 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 88 0D}我连这算不算奇怪都不知道……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 88 0D}记忆………我不知道。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 11 0B}听你这么一说，我想起来了，\n我也在“那边”见过蜘蛛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B0 11}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}那边……？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}就是来这所学校之前，\n还在塔尔塔罗斯里的时候。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}我记得，当时听见钟声，\n正想用人格面具探查一下，\n就看见了蜘蛛，但马上就找不到了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}山岸！真的吗！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 F0 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}是、是的。\n之后我马上就到了天鹅绒房间里，\n所以把这件事忘了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 09 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 0A}竟然有这种事……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:13:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}塔尔塔罗斯里，普通的生物应该……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}是……这样呢……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0142",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}对不起，要是我早点注意到就好了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:16:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E7 02}……其实我也见过。\n来这里之前，在我们学校里。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:16:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虽然蜘蛛没什么稀奇的，\n但钟声响起、蜘蛛出现……\n这一点是一样的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:17:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_016",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 08 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}也就是说……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:18:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0162",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 0F 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……到底是怎么回事？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_017",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0172",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B9 02}哈哈哈。\n确实，只是“看见过两次蜘蛛”而已。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0172",
  "translation": "{F2 05 01 FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}究竟有什么关系，\n之后再慢慢查吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0173",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}万一是敌人，导航就拜托你了。\n风花。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_018",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 05 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D7 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}好、好的！\n我会努力的！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:23:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A0 02}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}不是，我说的是万一啊！\n不用现在就这么有干劲！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:24:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_020",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 0B}……呵呵，我明白了！\n我会努力的！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_071.bf.json:25:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_021",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞和伙伴们度过了一段愉快的时光……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
